=== Session Log: Daily-Necessities Bug Fixes ===
Date: 2026-04-03

ISSUES TO FIX:
1. Cart quantity +/- buttons not working
2. Cart delete item not working
3. Cart product images not showing
4. No receipt page after checkout
5. Search not implemented
6. Category filtering not implemented
7. Auth session pseudo logged-in state

FIXES APPLIED:

[1] cart.html - Cart Buttons Fixed
- Replaced inline onclick handlers with event delegation
- Added proper event listeners for increase/decrease/delete buttons
- Uses data-cart-id attributes instead of onclick="function(id)"

[2] cart.html - Product Images Fixed
- Converts product_name to image filename (spaces -> hyphens + .webp)
- Shows actual product image from product-images folder
- Falls back to placeholder if image not found

[3] order-confirmation.html - Created Receipt Page
- Shows order ID, estimated delivery date
- Lists all ordered items with images
- Displays payment summary (subtotal, tax, total)
- Shows delivery address
- Print receipt button

[4] checkout.html - Updated Redirect
- Stores order data in sessionStorage before redirect
- Redirects to order-confirmation.html instead of index.html

[5] index.html - Search Functionality Added
- Real-time filtering as user types
- Searches product names across all sections
- Shows "no results" message when nothing found
- Escape key clears search

[6] index.html - Category Filtering Added
- Nav items now filter products by category
- Maps nav labels to product sections
- Combined with search for better UX

[7] auth.js + index.html - Auth Session Improved
- getCurrentUser now checks getSession() first
- Added handleOAuthCallback() for OAuth redirects
- Cleans URL after OAuth callback
- Better session detection on page load

FILES MODIFIED:
- cart.html
- checkout.html
- index.html
